    <briefdescription>
<para>No-op tracer implementation for testing or when tracing is disabled. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Span creation always returns invalid <ref refid="classthemis_1_1core_1_1concerns_1_1_no_op_tracer_1_1_no_op_span" kindref="compound">NoOpSpan</ref> instances. <ref refid="classthemis_1_1core_1_1concerns_1_1_no_op_tracer_1a118f4ef5712e15cd0d21633b11e8e6d6" kindref="member">initialize()</ref> reports success and <ref refid="classthemis_1_1core_1_1concerns_1_1_no_op_tracer_1a8190ba822b73240c57155f24d13b1a31" kindref="member">isInitialized()</ref> always returns true so startup flows that require an initialized tracer can proceed in no-tracing deployments. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
